2.1 Research License. Subject to the terms of this Agreement, Licensor grants
    Licensee a non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable, revocable
    license to use the Model for Research Use only.

2.2 Benchmark and Evaluation. Licensee may use the Model for participation in
    public AI benchmarks, leaderboards, and evaluation suites, and may publish
    benchmark results with proper attribution.

2.3 Derivative Models (Non-Commercial). Licensee may create Derivative Models
    for Research Use only. Any Derivative Model must:
    (a) include "K-AX Spartan" in its model name;
    (b) retain this License Agreement;
    (c) clearly indicate modifications made.

