4. RESTRICTIONS

Licensee shall NOT:

4.1 Use the Model for any Commercial Use without a separate commercial license.

4.2 Use the Model to develop, train, or improve AI models that directly compete
    with TeamSparta's products or services.

4.3 Remove, alter, or obscure any copyright notices, license terms, or
    attribution requirements associated with the Model.

4.4 Reverse engineer, decompile, or attempt to extract the training data,
    training methodology, alignment techniques, adapter fitting methods, or
    any other proprietary methods used to create the Model.

4.5 Represent that the Model or Derivative Models were developed by anyone
    other than TeamSparta Inc. or misrepresent the origin of the Model.

4.6 Use the Model for any purpose that violates applicable laws, including but
    not limited to: generating illegal content, facilitating fraud, mass
    surveillance, or violations of the Personal Information Protection Act
    of the Republic of Korea (개인정보보호법).

4.7 Use the Model to generate content that impersonates real individuals,
    creates non-consensual intimate imagery, or produces targeted harassment.

4.8 Distribute the Model weights through channels other than the official
    TeamSparta distribution (HuggingFace: teamsparta-inc) without prior
    written consent.

